{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvau6rrAePB2mnvaHfhj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't commit £60k yet, and don't drop it. Spend about a week on a cheap check, then decide against a pre-agreed threshold.**\n\n**Why not decide now:** The evidence is thin. It's one lost deal and three requests in a month. But you have a year of CRM data on 140 lost deals that nobody has analysed, and that is the obvious thing to check first. HR data is sensitive, so security reviews are likely to keep coming, especially if you're moving upmarket.\n\n**The check:**\n1. Review the 140 lost deals, including free-text notes, not just the loss-reason field. Reps often log \"no decision\" or \"went with competitor\" when security was the real blocker.\n2. Count open and stalled deals that have asked for SOC 2 or sent a security questionnaire.\n3. Ask whether competitors in lost deals hold SOC 2 or ISO 27001.\n4. Work out the revenue at stake: blocked deals × average contract value × win rate.\n\n**Decision rule (set it before looking):** If the revenue at risk over 12–18 months is clearly more than about 2–3× the £60k cost, start. If it's well under that, park it. If it falls in between, take the cheaper steps first.\n\n**Interim steps, whichever way it goes:**\n- Prepare a standard security pack (policies, a pen test summary, a completed questionnaire).\n- Tell prospects you have a SOC 2 audit scheduled. Many accept this.\n- Ask whether a Type I report is enough to unblock deals sooner.\n\n**Caveat:** I haven't seen the data. Contract value, sales cycle length and whether you're deliberately moving into enterprise could change the answer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3446,"cache_read_input_tokens":5036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3446},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5b8706b4-262e-4d03-9290-ca9da31b80cd","uuid":"efe764b8-56c9-4bd7-8d3a-27fb0d64b6f8","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:11:36.048Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvau6dDAPcRKthVUBbqP"}
